    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. So, based on the history and the examination, I think we're dealing with a wrist sprain, but a small fracture is possible at this stage. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together.",
